          "also": [
            "https://quarkus.io/guides/mongodb-panache"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "POJO codecs call an empty no-argument constructor by default. With annotation conventions enabled, BsonCreator selects a different constructor or public static creator; constructor parameters require BsonProperty or BsonId annotations. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/pojo-customization.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:f1ef91104426273788af40caa2b496258f12ab89aae3c2e5f9ebbdbd70c5a43e",
