          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Generic POJO properties require concrete bounded type parameters. ClassModelBuilder retains concrete type information to work around erasure; PropertyCodecProvider permits custom handling of generic property types. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/pojo-customization.md",
